%[text] # **Vented Hydrogen Deflagration Experiments**
%[text] # **Preliminary Results Campaign Week 22 2026**
%[text] %[text:anchor:T_D5D49718] # Data Processing Procedure (DPP)
%%
%[text] # **Exploratory Data Analysis (EDA)**
%[text] # Time Domain Analysis (EDA-TDA)
%%
%[text] %[text:anchor:H_23C559C1] ## 1. Setup (Matlab Startup File)
%[text] %[text:anchor:H_1B29D089] This m-File code prepare the environment to provide access to auxiliary files and sub-folders.
clear ; clc; close all;
format short eng
scriptRoot = fileparts(mfilename("fullpath"));
[projectRoot,AuxFcn_GS] = AuxFcn_Matlab_Startup_File_001;
auxRoot = fullfile(projectRoot, ...
    "3-Calculations-Files", "Matlab-Files", "Auxilliary_Functions");
mainFcnRoot = fullfile(projectRoot, ...
    "3-Calculations-Files", "Matlab-Files", "Main_Functions");
addpath(genpath(auxRoot));
addpath(genpath(mainFcnRoot));
%[text] #### Plots and Names Convention
%[text] Figures are identified using a compact and traceable name. The same convention will be used throughout preprocessing, exploratory data analysis, filtering, and QoI extraction:
%[text] `Fig-<Run>-<Comparison>-<Stage>-<Purpose>-F<NN>-<Detail>`
%[text] **Stage codes**
%[text] - `RAW`: raw data overview and loading diagnostics
%[text] - EDA-TDA: Exploratory Data Analysis-Time Domain Analysis
%[text] - EDA-FDA: Exploratory Data Analysis-Frequency Domain Analysis
%[text] - EDA-EWT: Exploratory Data Analysis-Empirical Wavelet Transform Analysis
%[text] - DPA-`FILT`: Data Processing & Analysis - filtering and sensitivity analysis
%[text] - DPA\*\*-\*\*`QOI`: Data Processing & Analysis - Quantity-Of-Interest extraction \
%[text] **Figure number**
%[text] - `F01`, `F02`, `F03`, ... identify multiple figures within the same run/section.
%[text] - `F` is used instead of `P` to avoid confusion with pressure sensor IDs such as `P3`, `P5`, or `P7`. \
%[text] **Examples**
%[text] - `Fig-Wk22-02-01-`EDA`-`TDA`-WoI-F01-Flush`
%[text] - `Fig-Wk22-03-01-`EDA`-`TDA`-F01-MountingMethods`
%[text] - `Fig-Wk22-03-01-`EDA`-`TDA`-WoI-F02-Recessed`
%[text] - `Fig-Wk22-03-01-`EDA`-`TDA`-WoI-F03-FlushBlind` \
%[text] In MATLAB, the figure ID should be assigned to the figure `Name` property, while the visible plot title can remain more descriptive for the report.
set(groot, 'defaultTextInterpreter', 'latex', 'defaultAxesTickLabelInterpreter','latex', 'defaultLegendInterpreter','latex');
LUCopper = [147, 86, 14]/255;LUCopper_Light = [225, 213, 199]/255;LUBlue = [17, 55, 125]/255;LUBlue_Light = [197, 204, 221]/255;
Red_Dark = [192, 0, 0]/255;Red_Light = [235, 200, 197]/255;pink = [255, 199, 206]/255;skyblue_light=[183/255 236/255 255/255];
%%
